      "description": "Плоская карточка гида r16, наведение заливкой.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-guide\" href=\"#\"><h3>Een pup in huis: de checklist voor de eerste weken</h3><p>Welke spullen heb je nodig voordat je pup komt.</p><span class=\"ds-foot\"><span class=\"ds-go\">Lees verder <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-meta\">6 min lezen</span></span></a>",
      "css": ":root{--canvas:#f2f2f7;--card:#fff;--fill:#f2f2f7;--ink:#1c1c1e;--muted:#5c5c61;--line:#d8d8dd;--blush:#fde8ef;--rasp:#e84b7a;--rasp-ink:#b5174f;--rasp-tint:rgba(232,75,122,.12);--mint:#1d9e75;--mint-ink:#127052;--mint-tint:rgba(29,158,117,.14);--lilac:#7b68ee;--lilac-ink:#4f3fc0;--lilac-tint:rgba(123,104,238,.14);--blue:#007aff;--ease:cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)} .ds-guide{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"SF Pro Text\",\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:340px;padding:24px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s}.ds-guide:hover{background:var(--fill)}.ds-guide:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--rasp-ink);outline-offset:2px}.ds-guide h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.32;font-weight:600}.ds-guide p{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.ds-go{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--rasp-ink);font-weight:600;font-size:15px}.ds-meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}"
